doc:Factsarticle_23 schema:abstract "Corrosion represents a critical structural challenge for marine vessels. The study investigates contour initialization and active contour algorithms for ship corrosion detection using a dataset of over 3700 ship corrosion images. The methodology uses a modified Wiener filter, pixel property contour initialization, a curve-restrained stopping function, a modified rubber sheet model, a 1D-log Gabor filter, and Hamming distance. It achieves 94.45% segmentation accuracy with an execution time of 0.91 seconds." .
_:f217f0ced33d69a4cdc44d58df5d430 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle_23 schema:abstract "Corrosion represents a critical structural challenge for marine vessels. The study investigates contour initialization and active contour algorithms for ship corrosion detection using a dataset of over 3700 ship corrosion images. The methodology uses a modified Wiener filter, pixel property contour initialization, a curve-restrained stopping function, a modified rubber sheet model, a 1D-log Gabor filter, and Hamming distance. It achieves 94.45% segmentation accuracy with an execution time of 0.91 seconds." )>> ;
